{"id":"2e27b623be13cf38","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-holomorphic.md","title":"Holomorphic Function","display":"df-holomorphic — Holomorphic Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-holomorphic","aliases":["58-df-holomorphic","Holomorphic Function"],"display":"df-holomorphic — Holomorphic Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-complex-differentiable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-holomorphic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-holomorphic</span><span>Holomorphic Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-holomorphic — Holomorphic Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e89388793704338b\" href=\"?note=e89388793704338b\" title=\"58-df-complex-differentiable\">58-df-complex-differentiable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,f\\in V\">\\(U,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,U)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e89388793704338b\" href=\"?note=e89388793704338b\" title=\"58-df-complex-differentiable\">58-df-complex-differentiable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U(f)\\)</span> (holomorphic predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,U)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Holomorphic}_U(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Holomorphic}_S(f,U)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an exact domain-indexed alias of the epsilon--delta definition in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e89388793704338b\" href=\"?note=e89388793704338b\" title=\"58-df-complex-differentiable\">58-df-complex-differentiable</a>.</li>\n<li>Entire: holomorphic on all of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C}\">\\(\\mathbb{C}\\)</span>; Liouville: bounded entire <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> constant</li>\n<li>Maximum modulus principle: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|f|\">\\(|f|\\)</span> cannot have local maximum unless constant</li>\n<li>Riemann mapping: any simply connected proper open <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neq \\mathbb{C}\">\\(\\neq \\mathbb{C}\\)</span> is biholomorphic to unit disk</li>\n<li>Normal families: uniformly bounded holomorphic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> has convergent subsequence</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ahlfors, Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, Functions of One Complex Variable</li>\n<li>Gunning, Analytic Functions of Several Complex Variables</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-complex-differentiable","status":"resolved","id":"e89388793704338b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-complex-differentiable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-complex-differentiable","status":"resolved","id":"e89388793704338b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerp